+        // rowStride * height (e.g. exactly rowStride*(height-1)+width-1). The
+        // naive loop below would then read one byte past the end and crash with
+        // IndexOutOfBoundsException (e.g. "index=153599 out of bounds
+        // (limit=153599)") on every frame, so detection never runs. Clamp every
+        // index to the last usable sample of each plane to stay inside the buffer.
+        val yLast = (yBuffer.remaining() - 1).coerceAtLeast(0)
+        val uLast = (uBuffer.remaining() - 1).coerceAtLeast(0)
+        val vLast = (vBuffer.remaining() - 1).coerceAtLeast(0)
